        e("dinitrogen_pentoxide", "Dinitrogen pentoxide", "N2O5", SubstanceCategory.MOLECULE, "Dinitrogen pentoxide is a powerful oxidising compound and an anhydride of nitric acid. It reacts with water to produce nitric acid."),
